# Build context for the LifeOS AI image (src/python/lifeos-ai/Dockerfile).
# Allowlist: only the project metadata, the lock file and the package sources. Tests, the local
# virtual environment, caches and every .env file never enter the context.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!src/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
